# From the medical crate the canyon floor east is a sniper field and the north
# slope is a collision trap. The route clears the overlooking guards from cover,
# detours down the lower valley, climbs the south rim, clears the rim guards and
# rides the first tyrol (TyrolTrigger0) to the far rim (NavPoint1). item108g/h
# fire fix: weapon presses honour bWeaponMode over a selected (put-away) hook, so
# the rifle fires along the live aim instead of a stale +X cache.
t=55.6 select_weapon 12
t=56.3 engage BaseSoldier15 5000 8 aim=0.9 period=0.4
t=56.4 select_weapon 12
